<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.
<p><strong>We're sorry for your wait</strong><br />
I'm sorry to hear about the lengthy wait you experienced, and we understand how frustrating it can be to have to hold for extended periods of time.<br />
<br />
We want our customers to have a smooth experience when they call us and make every effort to make that happen - from monitoring call wait times to rostering extra staff for busy periods.<br />
<br />
However, occasionally, call volumes are in excess of our predictions. When this happens we really appreciate your patience.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion &nbsp;</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for your understanding and for taking the time to let us know about your experience.</p>
</body>
